WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:05.425
★In the Netherlands, there is something called the floating solar farm. Solar panels are floating on the water, making it easier to change directions and move. Because of these features, they can follow the sun throughout the day. Another benefit of floating on the water is that it can prevent the rise in temperature, which is a disadvantage of solar panels.
